trong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>codecheck_precommit</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=3dd7f759b16146a08dcb8b11e5426b56&pipelineRunId=b84e242a54874f34b7a18cf6e24a6bef&projectName=CANN>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> </table><p>[2026-06-25 11:20:06] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CI执行结束 </p>","created_at":"2026-06-25T11:20:02+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-25T11:20:06+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177058794,"discussion_id":"21c745a64b90eb2bf1df396abfe0ba661b86cc58","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此PR修复了 `attention/block_sparse_attention_grad` 算子中当 tail 块大小为 0 时的精度问题。核心改动位于 `vec_op.h` 的 `ComputeEvenCoreInfo` 方法中：当 `info.len` 恰好被 `max_process_size` 整除（即 `tail == 0`）时，原先将 `align_tail` 错误地设为 0，导致 `SendVecPost`、`ComputeVecPost` 等方法的最后一轮循环因 `process_size == 0` 而提前 `break`，跳过了本应处理的最后一块数据。修复后将 `align_tail` 正确设为 `max_process_size`，确保尾块数据不被遗漏。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **`ComputeEvenCoreInfo` 尾块计算逻辑修正**：当 `tail == 0` 时，`align_tail` 由原来的 `0` 修改为 `max_process_size`，`pad_tail` 保持为 `0`，使得整除场景下最后一轮循环能正确处理完整的 `max_process_size` 个元素，而非被跳过。\n- **影响下游循环处理函数**：`SendVecPost`（第382-385行）、`ComputeVecPost`（第489-492行）和 `SendVecSftgFront`（第428-431行）中最后一轮循环的 `process_size` 取值依赖 `align_tail`，此修复确保它们在 `tail == 0` 时不会因 `process_size == 0` 而提前终止。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-25T11:46:26+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-25T11:46:26+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177059137,"discussion_id":"740e29d51e9c2936641e6cb306246be80a3d37a9","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n✅ 未发现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-25T11:47:47+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-25T11:47:47+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177077838,"discussion_id":"fc43e17ce516e36900fa2e4b36e4656507f41e4e","body":"/lgtm\n/approve","created_at":"2026-06-25T14:20:08+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-25T14:20:08+08:00","user":{"id":"6822c65e59bdd61f837dbc5a","login":"yu-xinjie62","object_id":"6822c65e59bdd61f837dbc5a","name":"於欣洁","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/yu-xinjie62"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177115759,"discussion_id":"eee1e803f07d88a8cad52dd6903ae0122fb7bb0b","body":"/lgtm\n/approve","created_at":"2026-06-25T16:25:39+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-25T16:25:39+08:00","user":{"id":"68e72b4a2dfaae57727b12a5","login":"yuhao_","object_id":"68e72b4a2dfaae57727b12a5","name":"yuhao_","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/yuhao_"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"}]